s in the night... Sisters Katie and Sophie go 'big cat crazy' to save some chests!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/84etgCgBDIRy4fww8r7JRYfJIng.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-17\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Wood, Glorious Wood\",\"overview\":\"Woodworker Bruce has a plan. He has some wood, but can he create luxurious loungers from Jacqui's garden furniture bound for the skip?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ibU6NzHoOpPhtF0O2y7AcGYbkQP.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-19\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Deck the Halls\",\"overview\":\"Mysterious material turns up at the tip, and Sarah Moore works a Christmas miracle to turn wooden boards into festive baubles.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yCUt3YjFRAX2B9tnOQWU7LmtR3D.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-24\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"A Stitch in Time\",\"overview\":\"Bag maker Neil pitches an idea for an old tent, and JJ Chalmers tries a first – turning a sewing machine stand into seating.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xXT1TRKqeEV0Z9bhPsLCCtzaknl.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-06-26\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Junk in the Trunk\",\"overview\":\"When is a trunk not a trunk? Sarah Moore needs to find a way to make a vintage trunk pack a profit, and upholsterer Ollie tries to nurse a dated chair back from the brink.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hbK2YGMVA0zwH0RuVO7e6Cuwaty.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-07-15\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Tune In and Cash Out\",\"overview\":\"Fish tank telly? JJ Chalmers has big ideas for a retro radio and TV set, but can he pull off two transformations he's never attempted before?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jSgN2ZgkjUG6UDZAKMgDzP9SG7a.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-07-17\",\"runtime\":43},{