,\"name\":\"Bamboozled\",\"overview\":\"Sarah Moore manages to grab a whole range of bamboo furniture, and Duncan has an electrifying idea for two old chandeliers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aIPrPG8j7taGR77uL81mGZXUlf1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-12\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Double Trouble\",\"overview\":\"'Rub-a-dub-dub', is there cash in the tub? In Wales, a pair of dated tub chairs really push new maker Ali out of her comfort zone.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/axH068wqLF0y6iqsbKNz4d2Pvtf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"Wooden It Be Nice?\",\"overview\":\"Chunky maple logs are sent to woodturner Chris's workshop, but will transforming them leave him stumped?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fG4csEzJIBhNhKysJbTPO5mgAkg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-14\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2015-09-07\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}